How sure: high that the import is the main cause and that the reps' conversion is normal. Less sure who prepared and requested the file. Dana Wexley denies it, and the chat messages are gone.

Next steps: Do not sign the performance plans or release the requisitions. Restate coverage using rep-created deals only (about 1.9x, below the 3.0x gate). Quarantine the 212 records. Preserve the source file and import job record, and interview Okafor and channel members about who posted the file.","methodChoice":"Collected X10, X11, X12, X4, X2 (5 of 5 items)."}
